  "notes": "Holds the goBILDA 5203 transfer motor coaxial with transfer shaft 3. Frame: origin on the shaft axis at the plate's outer face, motor toward -y. Flange (8 mm) against the plate with 4 M4 heat-set inserts (Ø5.6 x 6) for screws through the plate; tube around the 4007 coupler; square sleeve slides over the gearbox front (36.8 mm square opening). Print standing on the flange, PETG or nylon, 5 walls."
